{"id": "DeRKcWcxm4k", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why is Maa Kali's tongue out? 👅 There are TWO reasons… and the second one is hilarious 😂\n\n**1️⃣ The blood that created an army!** 🔱\n\nRaktabija (rakta = blood, bija = seed) had a terrifying boon: every drop of his blood that touched the ground created ANOTHER Raktabija.\n\nEvery hit made more of him. Soon, the battlefield was crawling with clones!\n\nThat's when Maa Kali emerged from Maa Durga's forehead. She spread her tongue across the battlefield, catching his blood before it could touch the ground.\n\nNo blood on the ground. No more clones. 🔥\n\n**2️⃣ Maa Kali's ultimate “OOPS!” moment 🙈**\n\nAfter the victory, her fierce dance threatened to shake the whole world. Lord Shiva lay down in her path to stop her.\n\nWhen Maa Kali accidentally stepped on him, she realised what she'd done and stuck out her tongue in surprise!\n\nThink of it as the divine version of: “OH! I didn't mean to do that!” 😂\n\nDid you know BOTH stories? Comment **JAI MAA KALI** 🌺\n\nAnd did you spot the clone taking a SELFIE? 🤳😂 Save this for Navratri and send it to someone who loves Maa Kali.\n\n📚 Maa's nine forms, retold as picture books for kids!\n\nBooks 1–3 are out now: Shailputri, Brahmacharini & Chandraghanta.\n\nSet of 3 for ₹500 · Book 7 (Maa Kalaratri) coming soon!\n\n👉 rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n#MaaKali #JaiMaaKali #Kali #Navratri #Navratri2026 #Raktabija #DeviMahatmya #MaaDurga #Durga #DurgaPuja #Shiva #HinduMythology #IndianMythology #KidsBooks #RishiKatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1791537387, "like_count": 11814, "comment_count": 76, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1080620294610297a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 52.112, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/